1. services/agri-data-service/src/agri_data_service/pipeline/parquet/lane_registry.py
================================================================================
Needed by `tests/direct/test_direct_package_registration.py`, which is default-deny over every
directory under `pipeline/direct/`. TWO OPTIONS; the file's owner picks, and the choice is a real
decision rather than a formality:

  OPTION A (this diff) -- a refusal adapter AND a `static_lookup` registration. Satisfies the test
  as written. COST: the registration declares a lane whose partition day is a version stamp, and
  this lane does not write day partitions at all, so its `history_floor` and `publication_lag_days`
  would be inert fields that read as coverage claims.

  OPTION B -- a refusal adapter only, plus an exemption entry in the registration test for a
  direct package that publishes a release-set generation rather than lane-days. Honest about the
  shape, but requires editing a shared test file this slice may not touch.

--- a/src/agri_data_service/pipeline/parquet/lane_registry.py
+++ b/src/agri_data_service/pipeline/parquet/lane_registry.py
@@ (after `_refuse_water_gauges_direct_export`, ~line 445)
 _refuse_water_gauges_direct_export: Final[LaneAdapter] = _source_direct_refusal(
     "agri_data_service.pipeline.direct.water_gauges"
 )
+# The botanical occurrence lane publishes a release-set GENERATION, not a lane-day, so this adapter
+# exists to satisfy the default-deny package registration rather than to route any write. Nothing
+# calls it on a successful path; `pipeline/direct/botanical_occurrences/forward.py` owns the write.
+_refuse_botanical_occurrences_direct_export: Final[LaneAdapter] = _source_direct_refusal(
+    "agri_data_service.pipeline.direct.botanical_occurrences"
+)

@@ (inside `_HAND_WRITTEN_REGISTRATIONS`, OPTION A only)
+    LaneRegistration(
+        slug="botanical-occurrences",
+        adapter=_refuse_botanical_occurrences_direct_export,
+        history_floor=date(2026, 9, 12),
+        publication_lag_days=0,
+        nature="static_lookup",
+        floor_basis=(
+            "NATURE static_lookup, and BOTH numbers above are INERT. This lane's unit is an immutable "
+            "release set addressed by content hash under `botanical-occurrences/<release_set_id>/`, not a "
+            "day under `layer=/kind=/zoom=/day=`. The floor is the day this registration was written and "
+            "is not a coverage claim; the lag is zero because a release is not settled by waiting. See "
+            "pipeline/direct/botanical_occurrences/AGENTS.md, 'The unit is a release set, not a day'."
+        ),
+    ),

