5. services/agri-data-service/src/agri_data_service/execution/job_executor_service.py
================================================================================
THREE duties, and the track spec is explicit that they are registered "only after implementation
review". They are written here rather than added.

  botanical-occurrences-source-refresh   weekly; checks the admitted collection's advertised version
                                         against the newest published release. READS NOTHING FROM A
                                         PORTAL BEYOND THE ADVERTISED VERSION and NEVER transfers:
                                         a transfer needs a granted permission verdict per URL.
  botanical-occurrences-repair           bounded; re-reads a quarantined archive after an operator
                                         fixed the refusal, and authors bounded follow-up work.
  botanical-occurrences-coverage-status  reports which release sets are published, which generation
                                         the pointer names, and every release whose outcome is
                                         `partial` or `quarantined`.

